<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερέω</span></b>  (B), 
			Ep.
		
		pres., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέρομαι</span>
			 (of which it is an 
				Ep.
			 form) and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερεείνω</span>:
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> c. acc. rei,
				<i>inquire into</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.375
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα . . ἐξερέεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.411
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.119
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>inquire of</i> a person, <i><span class="en">
				10.249
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				3.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>search through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνημοὺς ἐξερέῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.337
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>search for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1443
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
